# The build context is the repo root. .git is deliberately absent: the image revision comes
# from the KORI_REVISION build-arg (see apps/api/Dockerfile and apps/api/src/config.nims),
# never from a repository that happens to sit next to the Dockerfile. The rest is local
# scratch that must not travel into a layer.
.git
node_modules
apps/web/node_modules
mcp-results/
skills/
*.log
